   "body": "**Operator decision, 2026-11-11: option 1.** The current behaviour stays, as documented in `tooling/fixtures/README.md`.\n\nA signature or mood is cut at the last `</span>` before HFR's next element. An unknown HFR element printed right before the known tail is removed with the block.\n\nRationale:\n- The anonymizer fails safe: nothing leaks, and at worst some HFR content is over-redacted.\n- Raising instead would let a member's own unbalanced signature markup block publishing a capture.\n- The shape appears on no page of the corpus.\n- The differential tests against the current app would show missing HFR content.\n\nNo code change. Closing.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
   "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
